<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en" dir="ltr">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>SOCIALAPP PUBG</title>
<style>
*{margin:0;padding:0;box-sizing:border-box}
body{background:#0a0a0a; color:#fff; font-family:system-ui; min-height:100vh}
.top{height:36px; background:#111; display:flex; justify-content:space-between; align-items:center; padding:0 12px; font-size:12px; border-bottom:1px solid #222}
.top .uc{background:#ffcc00; color:#000; padding:4px 10px; border-radius:6px; font-weight:bold}
.header{background:#000; padding:12px; display:flex; justify-content:space-between; align-items:center; border-bottom:1px solid #222}
.logo{display:flex; align-items:center; gap:10px; font-weight:900; font-size:20px}
.logo span{color:#ffcc00}
.logo-icon{width:36px; height:36px; background:#ffcc00; border-radius:8px; display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center; color:#000}
.squad{background:#0a0a0a; padding:14px; border-bottom:1px solid #222}
.avatar{width:72px; height:72px; border-radius:18px; display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center; font-size:24px; font-weight:bold; position:relative; border:3px solid #ff9900}
.main-card{background:linear-gradient(180deg,#4a7a2a,#2d4a1a); min-height:420px; position:relative; padding:16px}
.main-card::after{content:'ERANGEL'; position:absolute; bottom:20px; left:10px; right:10px; font-size:78px; font-weight:900; color:rgba(0,0,0,0.15); text-align:center}
.bottom{position:fixed; bottom:0; left:0; right:0; background:#000; border-top:1px solid #222; display:flex; justify-content:space-around; padding:8px 0 12px}
.post-btn{width:64px; height:64px; background:#ffcc00; border-radius:20px; display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center; font-size:32px; color:#000; margin-top:-20px}
</style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="top"><div>🛡️ RP 57 🏆 ACE 12★</div><div style="display:flex; gap:8px"><div class="uc">UC 2,340</div><span>4G</span></div></div>
<div class="header"><div class="logo"><div class="logo-icon">◎</div><div>SOCIALAPP <span>PUBG</span></div></div><div><button style="border:1px solid #333; background:#111; color:#fff; padding:6px 14px; border-radius:8px">العربية</button></div></div>
<div class="squad">
<div style="display:flex; justify-content:space-between; font-size:11px; color:#888; margin-bottom:12px"><span>SQUAD • ONLINE</span><span>4/4</span></div>
<div style="display:flex; gap:14px">
<div style="text-align:center"><div class="avatar" style="background:linear-gradient(135deg,#ff9900,#ffcc00)">G</div><div style="font-size:11px; margin-top:4px">GHOST•OP</div></div>
<div style="text-align:center"><div class="avatar" style="background:#2a2a2a">S</div><div style="font-size:11px; margin-top:4px">SNIPER_KSA</div></div>
<div style="text-align:center"><div class="avatar" style="background:linear-gradient(135deg,#a855f7,#ec4899)">N</div><div style="font-size:11px; margin-top:4px">NOVA•Sara</div></div>
<div style="text-align:center"><div class="avatar" style="background:#111; border-style:dashed">+</div><div style="font-size:11px; margin-top:4px">YOU</div></div>
</div>
</div>
<div style="background:#0f0f0f; padding:12px; display:flex; gap:10px"><div style="width:40px; height:40px; background:#1a3a1a; border-radius:10px; display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center">G</div><div><div style="font-weight:bold">GHOST•OP 12m ago</div><div style="font-size:11px; color:#888">📍 Erangel • Pochinki ERANGEL</div></div></div>
<div class="main-card"><div style="background:rgba(0,0,0,0.6); padding:8px 12px; border-radius:12px; position:absolute; top:16px; left:16px">🔥 12 KILLS 1847 DMG</div><div style="background:rgba(0,0,0,0.6); padding:8px 12px; border-radius:10px; position:absolute; top:16px; right:16px">ALIVE 1 • 96</div></div>
<div class="bottom"><div>🏠 HOME</div><div>🔍 CLAN</div><div><div class="post-btn">+</div>POST</div><div>♡ LOOT</div><div>👤 PROFILE</div></div>
</body>
</html>
